ar verhaal had moeten kiezen. Haar wens opent opnieuw de toegang tot de School van Goed en Kwaad, maar bij terugkeer blijken de verhoudingen veranderd. Meisjes hebben zich georganiseerd zonder prinsen, terwijl Tedros en de andere jongens elders verblijven. Tussen de groepen dreigt een oorlog. Agatha en Sophie proberen te begrijpen wat hun eigen keuzes hebben losgemaakt en of zij de strijd kunnen voorkomen zonder hun onderlinge band opnieuw kwijt te raken.","work_id":987146034,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain existing Work3482 A World Without Princes / Soman Chainani and exact Dutch Een wereld zonder prinsen 9789402711578 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-023.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p436692872"],"reference":"work:3482","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-023.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17410022W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p436692872"]},{"note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789402711578","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15130867,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60455541M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholde