 plan de eerste koffiebar van de stad te openen. Voor dat nieuwe bestaan heeft ze meer nodig dan ervaring met een zwaard. Oude bekenden en de plaatselijke onderwereld kunnen haar plannen dwarsbomen, terwijl nieuwe partners onverwachte mogelijkheden bieden. Het verhaal volgt hoe Viv probeert iets blijvends te maken en leert dat samenwerking om een andere vorm van vastberadenheid vraagt dan vechten.","work_id":987146018,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain existing Work3326 Legends & Lattes / Travis Baldree and exact Dutch Legendes & Lattes 9789020555523 Hardcover. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-023.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p440511844"],"reference":"work:3326","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-023.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL27591348W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p440511844"]},{"note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789020555523","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15138951,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","editionKey":"/books/OL60585853M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"langua